        "id": "AuhmHF89tZkx"
      },
      "source": [
        "## Función Verdadera Oculta\n",
        "\n",
        "Usaremos como función oculta una sinusoidal."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {
        "id": "5oXydcvNtZkx"
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "def create_sinusoidal_data(spread=0.25, data_size=50):\n",
        "    np.random.seed(0)  # fijamos la semilla de aleatoriedad\n",
        "    x = np.linspace(0, 1, data_size)\n",
        "    y = np.sin(2 * np.pi * x) + np.random.normal(scale=spread, size=x.shape)\n",
        "\n",
        "    return x, y"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "p9WV_cgCtZky"
      },
      "source": [
        "## Muestra Ruidosa\n",
